support, all that stuff.

00:22:53.415 --> 00:22:55.290
Google's definition with
beta is a little bit

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:58.200
different than what most people
really think of as a beta.

00:22:58.200 --> 00:23:01.770
Our betas are typically
fully supported.

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:03.300
And we'll have full--

00:23:03.300 --> 00:23:07.937
the things are usually
locked down, everything else.

